WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.816
- Did either one of you ever do ballet?

00:00:01.816 --> 00:00:02.760
- No.

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.203
- I have taken ballet, yeah.

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:05.036
- You did?

00:00:05.036 --> 00:00:05.869
- I did, yeah.

00:00:05.869 --> 00:00:10.360
I mean, yeah, it was
more because I was doing

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.200
like musical theater and stuff growing up.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.940
So we had to take a ballet class,

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.160
but I actually quite enjoyed it.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.513
I mean, I really liked it a lot.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:19.660
- It's hard.
- Matter of fact,

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:20.493
we had to do it all.

00:00:20.493 --> 00:00:22.410
We had to do tap, jazz all that stuff.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.420
And ballet was by far my
favorite, I'm not sure why.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.960
- My husband did ballet, and he loved it.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.793
- That's so good.

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:28.870
Man, if you love it, you're good at it...

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:31.250
That was my, that was my weakest one, man.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:32.900
- I didn't love the dance belt.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.440
Didn't love the dance belt.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:35.950
- Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah. (laughs)

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:37.230
- For the men out there
that are not familiar

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:39.910
with what a dance belt does, it goes...

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:40.743
It's a thong.

00:00:40.743 --> 00:00:41.576
- It's a thong.

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:45.576
- It's a jock-strap thong hybrid.

00:00:45.576 --> 00:00:46.930
- You know what, though?

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:50.763
Just lean in and own it,
that's what I say. (laughs)

